  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "pyspark-execution.p1",
      "title": "PySpark - Execution Model",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "role": "title",
          "text": "PySpark - Execution Model",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 38,
            "minFontSize": 29,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "lineHeight": 1.16
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.title"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "role": "section",
          "text": "1. DataFrame vs RDD",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 27,
            "minFontSize": 23,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "lineHeight": 1.2
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.s1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Both are distributed collections. Only one of them gets optimised.",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b1"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "DataFrame: use it unless you have a reason not to.",
            "RDD: custom partitioners, non-tabular data, low-level control.",
            "Python UDFs break Catalyst's view - prefer built-in functions."
          ],
          "gap": 24,
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "minFontSize": 20
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "role": "section",
          "text": "2. Lazy Evaluation",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 27,
            "minFontSize": 23,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "lineHeight": 1.2
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.s2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Transformations build a plan. Nothing executes until an action asks for a result.",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b3"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Plan stages: parsed -> analyzed -> optimized -> physical -> RDDs.",
            "df.explain(True) prints all four.",
            "Errors in a typo'd column surface at analysis, not at write."
          ],
          "gap": 24,
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "minFontSize": 20
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "role": "section",
          "text": "3. Transformations vs Actions",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 27,
            "minFontSize": 23,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "lineHeight": 1.2
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.s3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If it returns a DataFrame it is lazy. If it returns data, a number, or writes files, it runs.",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b5"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "text": "Narrow",
                "marks": [
                  "key"
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " - select, filter, withColumn - no data movement."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "Wide",
                "marks": [
                  "key"
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " - groupBy, join, distinct, orderBy - shuffle."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "gap": 24,
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "minFontSize": 20
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b6"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "role": "section",
          "text": "4. Job / Stage / Task",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 27,
            "minFontSize": 23,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "lineHeight": 1.2
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.s4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The unit you tune is the task; the unit you read in the UI is the stage.",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b7"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "text": "Job",
                "marks": [
                  "key"
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " - one per action."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "Stage",
                "marks": [
                  "key"
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " - work between two shuffle boundaries."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "Task",
                "marks": [
                  "key"
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " - one per partition, per stage."
              }
            ]
          ],
          "gap": 24,
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 21,
            "lineHeight": 1.32,
            "overflow": "shrink",
            "minFontSize": 20
          },
          "id": "pyspark-execution.p1.b8"
        },
